    "title": "Blackberry Festival Returns To Lenoir On July 10 & 11 - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By FOCUS Newspaper ,\n5 hours ago Lenoir, NC – The North Carolina Blackberry Festival is a celebration of blackberries, cobbler, and fun! Held in Lenoir, North Carolina, the festival offers tons of family-friendly events. This is a FREE two day event. July 10 from 5:00 PM – 9:00 PM and July 11 from 9:00 AM – 9:00 PM. Read full article",
